// JSC worker engine — Zen-C trampolines.
//
// As of G8 (per-worker engine selection), the unified `worker_create`
// / `worker_post_message` / `worker_terminate` dispatchers live in
// `worker.zc` and call the engine-prefixed C symbols (`jsc_worker_*`)
// directly. This file pulls the C header into scope so the
// dispatcher's raw blocks have the symbols available.

@cfg(ZAPP_WORKER_ENGINE_JSC)
import "./jsc.h" as jsc_engine;
